100
00:05:00,220 --> 00:05:00,900
Move aside.

101
00:05:01,620 --> 00:05:02,420
Move aside.

102
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:17,780
Miss.

103
00:05:19,420 --> 00:05:20,000
Wang.

104
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:21,680
