151
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:11,220
Give it to me.

152
00:07:11,220 --> 00:07:11,720
Give it to me.

153
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,020
No.

154
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:14,940
Give it to me.

155
00:07:14,940 --> 00:07:15,740
No.

156
00:07:15,740 --> 00:07:16,580
Give it to me.

157
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,340
